  "content": "[Intro 1]\n[Dm]\n[Am7]\n[F]\n[A7]\n[Dm]\n[Am7]\n[F]\n[A7]\n\n[Intro 2]\n[Eb5]\n\n[Verse 1]\nDo you feel\n[Eb5]what I feel,\nSee what I\nsee,\nHear what I\nhear. There is\na line you draw.\nBetween your\ndream world and\nreality\nDo you live\nmy life or\nshare the breath I breathe.\n\n[Chorus]\n[D5]\n[Gb5]Lies\nfeed judgement of others Be-\nhold\nhow the blind lead each other\n[D5]The phi-\n[Db5]losopher\n[D5]You know so much about\n[Db5]nothing at all\n[Gb5]\n\n[Pre-Solo]\n[G5]\n[Bb5]\n[F5]\n[C5]\n\n[Solo 1]\n[G5]\n[Bb5]\n[F5]\n[C5]\n[G5]\n[Bb5]\n[F5]\n[C5]\n[G5]\n[Bb5]\n[F5]\n[C5]\n\n[Bridge]\n[A5]  [Eb5]  [Gb5]\n[D5]\n[A5]  [Eb5]  [Gb5]\n[D5]\n[Eb5][A5]Ideas that fall [Gb5]under\n[D5]shadows\n[A5]of [Eb5]theories [Gb5]that stand\n[D5]tall\n[A5]Thoughts [Eb5]that grow [Gb5]narrow\n[D5]\n[Eb5][A5]upon being [Gb5]verbally\n\n[Intrelude]\n[A5]released\n[Eb5]\n\n[Verse 2]\nYour mind is\n[Eb5]not your own,\nWhat sounds more\nmentally\nStimula-\nting is how\nyou make your choice\nSo you preach\nabout how\nI'm supposed to be,\nYet you don't\nknow your own\nsexuality\n\n[Chorus]\n[D5]\n[Gb5]Lies\nfeed judgement of others Be-\nhold\nhow the blind lead each other\n[D5]The phi-\n[Db5]losopher\n[D5]You know so much about\n[Db5]nothing at all\n[Gb5]\n\n[Outro]\n[G5]\n[Ab5]\n[G5]\n[Ab5]\n[D5]\n[Eb5]\n[D5]\n[Eb5]\n[G5]\n[Ab5]\n[G5]\n[Ab5]\n\n[Fade Out]\n[D5]\n[Eb5]\n[D5]\n[Eb5]\n[G5]\n[Ab5]\n[G5]\n[Ab5]\n[D5]\n[Eb5]\n[D5]\n[Eb5]\n[G5]\n[Ab5]\n[G5]\n[Ab5]",
